      <h2 id="expanding-pvc-filesystem_expanding-persistent-volumes" class="group scroll-mt-20">Expanding persistent volume claims (PVCs) with a file system<a href="#expanding-pvc-filesystem_expanding-persistent-volumes" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
