      <h2 id="expanding-recovering-from-failure_expanding-persistent-volumes" class="group scroll-mt-20">Recovering from failure when expanding volumes<a href="#expanding-recovering-from-failure_expanding-persistent-volumes" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
